{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0453_1000_p", "source_sha256": "c2eeedc8cfaefbf5428e345af0149b1b3acb851ea082710f7e21b5ed6755f5e6", "ja": "（今日はプロバスケの試合のハーフタイムショーに\n出演する真美の、ポスター撮影なのだが……）", "zh": "（今天要为参加职业篮球比赛中场表演的真美拍摄海报……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0453_1001_012mam", "source_sha256": "e3a37c144c2c73d0700aec00e883870069f43fe0330ad5f3e8036f5bea50ab6d", "ja": "はっ！　兄ちゃんサン！？", "zh": "啊！兄长！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0453_1002_p", "source_sha256": "8150a39f540815b95bb06a1696f0b057fc837e411861d26a4c5a4d393c94617e", "ja": "真美ごめん、遅くなった。\nちょっと急な電話が入って。準備はできてるか？", "zh": "真美，抱歉，我来晚了。\n刚才接到了个紧急电话。准备好了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0453_1003_012mam", "source_sha256": "235e7dda991c94fd4a643402351c42132bc3ffe6a81f164f0d437be7f409ed36", "ja": "う、うん、真美は大丈夫。問題ないよ？\nどこも、なにも壊れてないよ？　……ですよ？", "zh": "呜、嗯，真美没事。没问题哦？\n哪里都没有、什么都没坏哦？……真的哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0453_1006_p", "source_sha256": "7866fdb514663c1a5d4584cb244be302c0f5d29d840001d068cb8b4aeccdb6c6", "ja": "なんだ、どこでなにをした！？　あっ、部屋の隅に\nバスケットボールが……真美が持ってきたのか？", "zh": "怎么回事，你到底在哪儿做了什么！？啊，房间角落里有个篮球……是真美带来的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0453_1007_012mam", "source_sha256": "90d60f6bc01f613eabc965dc275f8d6d1bfcb95cb3956322eaec41aa5499566b", "ja": "ぎくっ！　い、いや～、撮影の小道具っぽいよ？\n気持ちを入れようと思って、借りてきたんだけど……。", "zh": "咯噔！不、不是啦～看起来像是拍摄用的道具吧？我想着要投入点感情，就借来了，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0453_1008_p", "source_sha256": "79a59c4b86a959c47bdcbb26edc6c8d8085e97dc4fb4ae36f92d11c436f46f3a", "ja": "そうか。よし、もう少し近くで、よく見てみよう。", "zh": "这样啊。好，那就再靠近一点，仔细看看吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0453_1009_012mam", "source_sha256": "32b49527e4d190bb850fcde29316cc93a7d72663e431372b0fa375cff93617eb", "ja": "あっ、待つんだ兄ちゃん！　ええと、そっちは\n方角が悪いかもしんない！　カムバーック！", "zh": "啊，等等老哥！呃，那边\n方位可能不太吉利！快回来——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0453_1010_p", "source_sha256": "5ad0c95b0752b98238828fcc5576d1c593124a0ed50c02380bbc002b08c5b804", "ja": "……あれ？　ボールのそばの椅子、歪んでるような……\nあっ、よく見たら脚が外れてる！", "zh": "……咦？球旁边的椅子，好像有点歪了……\n啊，仔细一看，椅子腿都脱落了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0453_1011_012mam", "source_sha256": "1f544f105a5a34a057c243533d9bcef1a5fafb50ba85af9e3893e72cb8b76d9a", "ja": "うあうあ～、ごめんなさ～い！　違うんだよ、ちょっと\nバスケ感を出そうと思ってボールで遊んでただけなの！", "zh": "呜哇呜哇～，对不起～！不是那样的啦，真美只是\n想稍微表现出一点篮球的感觉，才拿球玩了一下的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0453_1012_012mam", "source_sha256": "497f8c25d6f00fe6396ef33a0ee1ccacece17adb12244f9bd541148f2395a79e", "ja": "撮影！　そう、すべては撮影のために！　で、バンバン\nドリブルしてたら、ボールが椅子に猛チャージして……", "zh": "拍摄！没错，一切都是为了拍摄！然后我砰砰地运着球，结果球猛地撞上了椅子……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0453_1013_p", "source_sha256": "d4e031113f370ba4e32993a28b4ca8d06aadd7eac0095aeb955a7017b1e2737f", "ja": "なんてことを……！　\nえぇと……。", "zh": "怎么会这样……！\n呃……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0453_1014_p", "source_sha256": "036b0f6401bf8c598eaf0da207892c47f8eb329dced463612b44e72cc63d6794", "ja": "あ！　いや、いけるぞ！　ネジが外れただけみたいだ。\n回せば……、よし、元通りだ！　セーフ！", "zh": "啊！不对，能修好！好像只是螺丝掉了而已。\n拧上的话……好，恢复原样了！安全过关！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0453_1015_012mam", "source_sha256": "040e792820e77e35a712498b0fa0298abcf2a4780f6d729e13872070513af5e3", "ja": "ホント！？　うわーん、よかったよー！\n兄ちゃん天才～！", "zh": "真的！？呜哇——太好了呀——！\n哥哥真是天才～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0453_1016_p", "source_sha256": "9d604dfc395b9eb8f3004c4a8015c137f3252be4f065a7f389092e2c47be40a9", "ja": "まったく……俺が遅くなったのも悪かったけど、\nよそ様の控え室では、行儀よくしてくれないと。", "zh": "真是的……虽然我迟到也有责任，\n但在别人的休息室里，可得规矩一点才行啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0453_1017_012mam", "source_sha256": "4f8e1b6c49eccacd9f876679ec26f26e6f9d000ae5ba2970766c721fd9938d45", "ja": "うん……ゴメンね、兄ちゃん。\n真美、早くバスケしたくて……。", "zh": "嗯……对不起，哥哥。\n真美只是想早点打篮球……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0453_1018_p", "source_sha256": "88a65e75b7fbc1863b78e19ced9eb520360f7662dd28a94e592699fcf608ece0", "ja": "……まあ、小道具にさわって気持ちを作っておくのは\n大事だし。この後の撮影、頼りにしていいな？", "zh": "……嘛，先摸摸道具进入状态\n也很重要。接下来的拍摄，我可以期待你的表现吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0453_1019_012mam", "source_sha256": "32b0689ace1481b58533af4b2bc496314003102072796cf769eca94884bb7534", "ja": "！　もちろん！　ドリブルしまくったおかげで、\n今の真美は世界にダンクできる気分だよ！", "zh": "！当然！多亏一直运球，现在的真美感觉连全世界都能扣篮了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0453_1020_p", "source_sha256": "b08ced04d0cba4d2633b926f48eaa385fa8793e42225643a3ac946a06bd14c22", "ja": "よし、よくわからないがその意気だ。\nじゃあスタジオに行こう！", "zh": "好，虽然不太明白，但有这股干劲就好。\n那我们去摄影棚吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0453_1021_p", "source_sha256": "d5c3c9e1d3bbbfa6ad47027a534fc3c9bcfe72a62f9e9116bb538bd50b31781e", "ja": "（その後、真美は躍動感あふれる表情をたくさん見せて\nくれた。椅子の謝罪も無駄じゃなかったな！）", "zh": "（之后，真美展现出了许多充满活力的表情。看来向椅子道歉也没有白费！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
